  id: SeaStarSpire
  displayName: Star Spire
  description: 'A slender crystal spire throwing a star-coloured beam out over the
    sea. Beam: 30 tiles. Its beam guides your boats (they fish more and come home
    safely), speeds ships along, keeps pirates off your sea routes, and burns raiders''
    and pirates'' hulls.'
